          "short": "Verified: $\\log_3 81=4$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_3 81&=\\frac{\\log_{10}81}{\\log_{10}3}\\\\\\log_3 81&=4.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
