        "answer": {
          "short": "Verified: $\\log_{100}10\\,000=2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{100}10\\,000&=\\frac{\\log_{10}10\\,000}{\\log_{10}100}\\\\\\log_{100}10\\,000&=\\frac{4}{2}\\\\\\log_{100}10\\,000&=2.\\end{align*}$$",
